PDFsharp and MigraDoc 6.5.0 are built by this project from empira's AGPL
source (https://github.com/empira/PDFsharp, tag v6.5.0, commit
96d5ef81d304d314228712e28e5d7ac3d5e29f86), a git submodule of this
repository, and so is the WeCantSpell.Hunspell 7.0.1 spell checker. The
