docs/third-party-source-builds.md say more.

Where the source is: the complete source of each release, the Corresponding
Source of everything its setup installs, is the source archive
OpenPmsDental-<version>-source.zip published with the release, next to the
setup. It holds this repository at the release commit and the PDFsharp and
WeCantSpell.Hunspell submodules at the commits that commit pins.

